      "statement": "The ADR is conditional on an untested §3 premise — that OpenSearch 3 drops bcprov-jdk15to18 1.79 and carries netty ≥ 4.1.137.Final — with the ratified fallback that if the scan clears neither advisory OpenSearch stays on `<3` and both OpenSearch allowlist entries are re-dated to 2026-12-01 with a justification naming the scanned 3.x digest and what it still bundled.",
