      "id": "claim_3aca34955f584b6ca45b98526d2fcbb7",
      "statement": "Amendment §4a (2026-09-13) supersedes §4 for OpenSearch only: the mcm-agent-audit store IS preserved via snapshot and restore, measured at 5,276 documents / 326.9 kb, because the benefit halved (only bcprov discharged) while the cost became knowable and cheap — the restore is verifiable by exact document count and upstream lists snapshot-and-restore as a supported adjacent-major upgrade method. The Langfuse half is unaffected and completed under §4 as written.",
