      "statement": "The 5,276-document measurement nearly did not happen: `_cat/indices/mcm-agent-audit-*` returned only a header row because the pattern needs a trailing dash and the real index is `mcm-agent-audit`, and that zero was one step from justifying destruction of a security audit trail — so a zero from a filtered query means \"no match\", not \"no data\".",
