      "id": "claim_d56d9127ed464e1586015e167e7821da",
      "statement": "Langfuse 4 broke a verification rather than only an image: GET /api/public/traces is removed (404), which was exactly the endpoint the SC-008 integration test polled for per-turn cost and latency, so the read path moved to `observations.get_many(session_id=…, is_root_observation=True)` with explicit fieldsets because v4's observations API is sparse — a correct-looking migration returned real turns and latency while reporting `cost_usd=None`, which reads as \"the model wasn't priced\" rather than \"the field wasn't requested\".",
