    {
      "id": "claim_5820efdc8cc04b0396fd9b8a6a9444de",
      "statement": "The OpenSearch cutover had to sequence allowlist and Renovate changes into the same commit as the image move: the netty entry is keyed to the 2.x digest and would leave six fixable CRITICALs un-allowlisted on the 3.x image, the bcprov entry keyed to `:2` would report UNMATCHED, and the `<3` ceiling guard would red against a tree deploying 3.x — so image move, entry delete, entry re-key and ceiling lift landed together and only then did the post-merge real sweep prove the discharge.",
