    {
      "id": "claim_b00521e720c041319b9b35f9c1bfc7c4",
      "statement": "ADR-0002 rejected two standing alternatives and kept one as fallback: upgrading only one of the two leaves either an un-dischargeable floating-major suppression (langfuse/*:3) or the longest-open seed suppression, one combined spec for both majors would share a single ambiguous CI signal, and staying put with re-dating is legitimate but compounding because the seed entry ages while the argument to move stays identical.",
      "evidence": [
