      "id": "claim_b5cff26f478849c49594f570153f7284",
      "statement": "The Langfuse half ran the same gate criteria as OpenSearch and passed clean on all three moving images (langfuse/langfuse:4, langfuse/langfuse-worker:4 and clickhouse-server:25.12), with CVE-2026-75604 / GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4 absent because the bundled package is next 16.3.3 — the fixed version the allowlist justification named — which is the distinction that justifies deleting a suppression rather than merely observing an absent finding.",
